WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.136
&gt;&gt;&gt; THE JANUARY 6 COMMITTEE WILL
HOLD WHAT COULD BE THE FINAL

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:06.539
PUBLIC HEARING THIS WEDNESDAY.
ONE RMER ADVISER TO THE

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:10.076
COMMTEE IS NOW RAISING NEW
QUESTIONS ABOUT WHAT WAS

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:13.146
HAPPENING INSIDE OF THE WHITE
HOUSE DURING THE JANUARY 6

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:15.348
INSURRECTION.
IN A NEW INTERVIEW, A FORMER

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:21.421
SENIOR TECHNICAL ADVISER DENVER
RIGGLEMAN SAID THAT A CAPITOL

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:25.892
RIOTER HAD A SHORT CALL WITH THE
WHITE HOUSE ON THE DAY OF THE

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:28.695
ATTACK.
&gt;&gt; WE GET A REAL AHA-MOMENT WHEN

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:33.800
YOU SEE THAT THE WHITE HOUSE
SWITCHBOARD HAD CONNECTED TO A

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.701
RIOTER'S PHONE WHILE IT WAS
HAPPENING.

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:42.709
&gt;&gt; SOMEONE IN THE WHITE HOUSE
WAS CALLING THE WHILE THE RIOT

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:46.579
WAS GOING ON.
&gt;&gt; SO A CALL FROM THE WHITE

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:49.749
HOUSE TO A RIOTER, RIGHT IN THE
MIDDLE OF THIS.

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:53.419
WHAT DO WE KNOW ABOUT THE CALL
AND HOW LONG IT WAS AND WHO

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:58.391
WITH-T WENT TO OR ANYTHING ELSE.
&gt;&gt; WE KNOW A FEW THINGS.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:01.161
THIS IS THE ONLY KNOWN CALL FROM
A WHITE HOUSE TO THE RIOTER

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:06.299
WHILE THE RIOT WAS TAKING PLACE.
BUT THERE IS A FEW PLACES THINGS

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:11.070
ON HERE FROM JAMIE GANGEL AND
ELIZABETH STEWART.

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.273
THE PUBLICLY AVAILABLE NUMBER
FOR THE WHITE HOUSE, IT LASTS

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:16.709
FOR ONLY 9 SECONDS.
WHO PLACED THE CALL AND WHY

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:19.913
REMAINS A MYSTERY.
PHONE LOGS DON'T REVEAL ANY

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:22.182
EXTENSION OF THE LINE.
BUT WE HAVE LEARNED THAT THE

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:28.288
RIOTERS WHO RECEIVED THAT IS
NAMED ANTON LEWANIC FROM

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:29.822
BROOKLYN.
THEY WERE ONLY IN THE CAPITOL

00:01:29.822 --> 00:01:32.926
FOR A FEW MINUTES AND HE'S SEEN
ON A CELL PHONE VIDEO LEAVING

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.627
THE CAPITOL BUILDING THROUGH A
WINDOW.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:38.998
THAT CALL HAPPENED AFTER THEY
LEFT THE CAPITOL AND LEWANIC WAS

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:42.235
LIKELY ON HIS WAY BACK TO NEW
YORK, HIS HOME ALREADY.

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:45.672
ACCORDING TO ONE SOURCE THOUGH,
THE HOUSE COMMITTEE CONTINUES TO

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:50.310
INVESTIGATE THIS CALL BUT SO FAR
THEY'VE BEEN UNABLE TO DISCOVER

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:55.748
WHO PLACED IT OR WHY.
ZOE LOVE AGAIN DOWNPLAYED THE

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:59.419
COMMENTS YESTERDAY ON CNN.
HERE SHE IS ON THE COMMITTEE'S

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:01.054
WORK.
&gt;&gt; EVERYTHING THAT HE WAS ABLE

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:06.392
TO RELAY OR TO DISCERN PRIOR TO
HIS DEPARTURE HAS BEEN FOLLOWED

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:13.600
UP ON AND IN SOME CASES DIDN'T
REALLY PETER OUT OR THERE MIGHT

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:17.470
HAVE BEEN A DECISION, A
SUGGESTION THAT THERE WAS A

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:22.075
CONNECTION BETWEEN ONE NUMBER OR
ONE EMAIL AND A PERSON THAT

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:25.612
TURNED OUT NOT TO PAN OUT.
SO WE FOLLOW UP ON EVERYTHING.

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:30.216
&gt;&gt; SO EARLIER THIS YEAR, LEWANIC
AND HIS TWO FRIENDS PLEADED

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:33.720
GUILTY INTO FEDERAL COURT TO
DEMONSTRATED IN THE CAPITOL.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:36.923
THEY WERE SENTENCED TO HOME
CONFINEMENT AND PROBATION.

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:39.926
ATTORNEYS FOR ALL THREE MEN
DECLINED TO COMMENT TO CNN AND

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:42.395
PROSECUTORS NEVER MENTIONED THIS
CALL DURING THE COURT

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:44.998
PROCEEDINGS.
BUT ACCORDING TO MULTIPLE

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:50.136
SOURCES FAMILIAR WITH THIS
INVESTIGATION, LEWANIC SAID HE

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:51.671
DOESN'T REMEMBER RECEIVING THE 9
SECOND CALL AND DOESN'T KNOW

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:53.406
ANYONE WHO WORKED IN THE TRUMP
WHITE HOUSE.

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:56.442
SO JIM, THERE IS STILL A LOT OF
MYSTERY HERE AND IT IS REALLY

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:58.945
HARD TO SAY AT THIS TIME HOW
SIGNIFICANT THIS DETAIL IS.

00:02:58.945 --> 00:03:00.980
&gt;&gt; NO QUESTION.
OUTGOING CALL.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:01.648
KAITLAN POLLANCE, THANK YOU VERY

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:04.517
MUCH.
LET'S GET INSIGHTS FROM MANU

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:09.622
RAJU.
SEUNG MIN KIM OF THE ASSOCIATED

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:15.361
PRESS AND FORMER FEDERAL
PROSECUTOR WU.

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:19.732
THAT'S THE FORMER CONGRESSMAN,
AN ADVISER TO THE COMMITTEE.

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:22.502
HE SAYS IT'S AN AH-HA MOMENT.
SEVERAL MEMBERS OF THE COMMITTEE

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:24.370
SAY MAYBE NOT.
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW WHAT MR.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.907
RIGGLEMAN IS DOING REALLY.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S ONE OF THOUSANDS OF

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:29.709
DETAILS THAT OBVIOUSLY THE
COMMITTEE IS AWARE OF.

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:34.080
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE BEEN VERY CAREFUL
ABOUT WHAT WE SAY, NOT TO OVER

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:37.250
STATE MATTERS, NOT TO UNDER
STATE MATTERS AND WITHOUT THE

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.851
ADVANTAGE OF THE ADDITIONAL
INFORMATION WE HAVE GATHERED

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:43.656
SINCE HE LEFT THE COMMITTEE, YOU
KNOW, I THINK IT POSES REAL RISK

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:48.261
TO BE SUGGESTING THINGS.
&gt;&gt; WHY ARE COMMITTEE MEMBERS SO

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:50.830
DOWN ON WHAT IT IS.
MAYBE THERE'S NOTHING THERE BUT

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.665
JUST THE IDEA THAT SOMEBODY FROM
THE WHITE HOUSE CALLED SOMEBODY

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:56.436
